  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n36 ÷ (8 × 3) - [3 ÷ {4 × {3 × 4 ÷ (5 - 9) + 6}}]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/eafd54de9d9fc295c072d1fa0b8367ee3ed24189b7ad133a51c29266134693c4.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n36 ÷ (8 × 3) - [3 ÷ {4 × {3 × 4 ÷ (5 - 9) + 6}}]\n\n⇒ 36 ÷ 24 - [3 ÷ {4 × {3 × 4 ÷ (- 4) + 6}}]\n\n⇒ 36 ÷ 24 - [3 ÷ {4 × {3 × (- 4/4) + 6}}]\n\n⇒ 36 ÷ 24 - [3 ÷ {4 × {3 × (- 1) + 6}}]\n\n⇒ 36 ÷ 24 - [3 ÷ {4 × {- 3 + 6}}]\n\n⇒ 36 ÷ 24 - [3 ÷ {4 × 3}]\n\n⇒ 36 ÷ 24 - [3 ÷ 12]\n\n⇒ 36 ÷ 24 - (1/4)\n\n⇒ 3/2 - 1/4\n\n⇒ (6 - 1)/4\n\n⇒ 5/4\n\n⇒ 1.25\n\nSo, this is lies in between 1 and 1.3\n\n**∴ Required answer is Option 2.**",
